// Coverage focus filter (passed to every verilate() under VL_COVERAGE).
// Turns coverage instrumentation OFF for the testbenches so the merged report
// scopes to the synthesizable RTL (rtl/*.sv). Substring globs (leading '*'):
// the stored source paths mix '/' and '\' separators, so anchor on the basename
// fragment, not the directory.
`verilator_config
coverage_off -file "*tb_*"
coverage_off -file "*verilated_std*"
